  "abstract": "Serve Z.ai GLM open-weight models (GLM-5.3, GLM-5.3-Flash, GLM-5.2, GLM-4.7 and GLM-4.7-Flash) on DGX Spark, consumer RTX, Apple Silicon and H100 to B200 servers. Covers model sizes, context and licences, glm45 and glm47 tool and reasoning parsers for vLLM, SGLang and TensorRT-LLM, llama.cpp and Ollama notes, reasoning_effort and clear_thinking toggles, sampling, official and community quants, and known bugs. References are split into models, parsers and templates, platforms and quants, and known issues.",
